    196  3ead
    197  3ead							; The vibrato, glide and detune the SID uses (FxTick, voices.asm). Each is
    198  3ead							; the menu's choice: AS SOUND (the sound's), ON (the ADVANCED SOUND values),
    199  3ead							; OFF. VIBRATO or GLIDE held turns on what's off (the ADVANCED SOUND values;
    200  3ead							; a held VIBRATO has no delay); TAPE WOBBLE held: a deep slow vibrato, each
    201  3ead							; voice its own phase; WIDE held: the detune about twice as wide.
    202  3ead				   FxVars
    203  3ead					      subroutine
    204  3ead		       20 84 30 	      jsr	SyncCalc	; (v0.58: TREMOLO, VIBRATO and PWM SYNC at this tempo)
