    515  5e94							; ------------------------------------------------------------ actions
    516  5e94							; What SPACE and the keytar's buttons do (menu: SPACE, ... BUTTON):
    517  5e94							;   held     MUTE, BEND DOWN, BEND UP, VIBRATO, TREMOLO, ARP, STUTTER,
    518  5e94							;	      VINYL STOP, GLIDE, SUSTAIN, OCTAVE UP, REPEAT, FILTER SWEEP,
    519  5e94							;	      BEAT FILL, TAPE WOBBLE, WIDE
    520  5e94							;   a press  TAP TEMPO, BEAT ON/OFF, NEXT SOUND; or NOTHING
    521  5e94							; A held action can be held by several at once; it ends when the last lets go.
    522  5e94							;
    523  5e94							; A = action, t3 = 1 pressed / 0 let go
